msgid "Produces evidence, not verdicts: Task_Gates going red does not end the process or loop by itself — \"this version breaks us\" is a finding the decider needs to see, not a reason for this lane to stop the run — and Task_Mvp exists so that finding is checked against a real deployed build rather than a description of one."
msgstr ""

